{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2393/content00792?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链案例&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #3f75f3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">引 言</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">数据显示，中国母婴市场规模已达3.75万亿元，母婴用品市场也呈现出新的发展趋势。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">母婴用品线上、线下销售渠道加速拓展与整合，这对于仓储、物流提出更高的要求，母婴用品商家积极寻求更高效的解决方案，以满足客户的需求，获得更高的市场增量。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">基于多年在母婴行业的深耕，京东物流精准洞察消费市场，发现母婴用品行业集中度不断提升，线上渠道占比不断提升，多渠道拓展已经成为品牌发展新趋势。在新趋势背景下，品牌及商家对于供应链网络优化、全渠道履约管理、仓库多业务融合的信息技术和自动化管理等需求持续加深。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">作为中国领先的技术驱动的供应链解决方案及物流服务商，京东物流充分发挥一体化供应链的优势，推出<span style=\"color: #3f75f3;\">&ldquo;线上多渠道一盘货管理、线下分仓管理&rdquo;的母婴用品行业定制化解决方案，通过数智化赋能，推动渠道下沉，帮助合作伙伴实现供应链提效降本，助力母婴商家在行业竞争中降本增效、实现领先优势</span>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1691135342882.jfif\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1691135362601.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01325", "contentTitle": "一图看懂丨母婴行业一体化供应链解决方案", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1691134215000, "id": 3244, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1691135389796.jfif", "updateTime": 1691135668000}}